#. module: KSW_working_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:KSW_working_schedule.field_resource_calendar__x_saturday_short_overtime
msgid ""
"When set, Saturday is a short shift (<8h). The gap between a full 8h day and"
" the actual Saturday hours is deducted and credited back 1:1 as overtime on "
"the payslip (net-zero reclassification, like the full-day Saturday Required "
"option). Used for schedules such as \"Standard 44 hours/week\" (Sat 3h) and "
"\"Abdullah Mutawa Special Shift\" (Sat 4h)."
msgstr ""

#. module: KSW_working_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:KSW_working_schedule.field_resource_calendar__x_saturday_required
msgid ""
"When set, Saturday is treated as a required workday for attendance-sheet "
"purposes even if it has no schedule line in this calendar. Absences are "
"deducted normally and an equal amount is credited back as Saturday overtime "
"on the payslip."
msgstr ""

#. module: KSW_working_schedule
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:KSW_working_schedule.field_resource_calendar__x_skip_attendance_issues
msgid ""
"When set, late-arrival and early-departure minutes are not recorded for "
"employees using this schedule. Use for roles where shift times vary "
"frequently (e.g. executives). Absence detection is still active."
msgstr ""

